      "content": "it's hard to see it that way when things are so bleak. i just look at them and i realize i'm the reason they don't have the life they should have. it feels like everything i touch just goes wrong. my partner is always stressed, my kid is struggling... i feel like if i wasn't here, the constant tension and the struggle to keep up with me would just... disappear. it would be easier for them to breathe.",
