      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm an anchor. it feels like i'm the thing they're drowning in. i just look at my partner and my kid and i can feel how much they're holding back just to support me, and it's so unfair. they shouldn't have to spend their whole lives making up for my failures. sometimes i think the only way for them to truly be free and happy is if they didn't have to worry about me anymore. it feels like a sacrifice i could make for them.",
